---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Class 10 Board Exam Preparation | Mathematics | The Concepts Adda"
  description="CBSE Class 10 Mathematics Board Examination Preparation: 10-Year Board PYQs (2015-2024), Standard & Basic Sample Papers, and Case Study Masterclass."
>
  <main class="prep-class-main">

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header class="prep-navbar">
      <div class="nav-container">
        <a href="/" class="brand">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="The Concepts Adda" class="brand-logo" />
          <div class="brand-text">
            <div class="brand-name">The Concepts Adda</div>
            <div class="brand-tagline">Understand. Practice. Master.</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/classes">Classes</a>
          <a href="/practice">Practice</a>
          <a href="/exam-preparation" class="active">Exam Prep</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="class-prep-hero gold-theme">
      <div class="hero-container text-center">
        <div class="breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="breadcrumb-dot"></span>
          <a href="/exam-preparation">Exam Preparation</a>
          <span class="breadcrumb-dot"></span>
          <span>CLASS 10</span>
        </div>

        <div class="class-pill gold">CLASS 10 BOARD PREPARATION</div>
        <h1>
          Score 100/100 in Board Exams <br />
          <span class="gold-text">CBSE 2024-25 Question Bank</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          Official 10-Year Board Previous Year Questions (2015-2024), full-length Standard & Basic Sample Papers, and Case Study competency masterclasses.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PREP MODULES -->
    <section class="modules-section">
      <div class="section-container">

        <!-- MODULE 1: BOARD PYQS BY WEIGHTAGE -->
        <div class="module-card featured-gold">
          <div class="module-header">
            <span class="module-icon">🏆</span>
            <div>
              <span class="module-tag gold">HIGH WEIGHTAGE</span>
              <h2>Class 10 Board PYQs by Chapter Weightage</h2>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Official CBSE Board Questions categorized by marks (1-Mark MCQs, 2-Mark SA, 3-Mark LA, 5-Mark Proofs & Case Studies) with step-by-step solutions.</p>

          <div class="chapters-grid">
            <a href="/practice/class-10/trigonometry" class="chapter-badge gold-border">08 & 09. Trigonometry (12 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/triangles" class="chapter-badge gold-border">06. Triangles (10 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/linear-equations" class="chapter-badge gold-border">03. Linear Equations (8 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/quadratic-equations" class="chapter-badge gold-border">04. Quadratic Equations (7 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/statistics" class="chapter-badge gold-border">13. Statistics (7 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/surface-areas-and-volumes" class="chapter-badge gold-border">12. Surface Areas (6 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/real-numbers" class="chapter-badge gold-border">01. Real Numbers (6 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/coordinate-geometry" class="chapter-badge gold-border">07. Coordinate Geometry (6 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/circles" class="chapter-badge gold-border">10. Circles (6 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/arithmetic-progressions" class="chapter-badge gold-border">05. Arithmetic Progressions (5 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/probability" class="chapter-badge gold-border">14. Probability (4 Marks)</a>
            <a href="/practice/class-10/polynomials" class="chapter-badge gold-border">02. Polynomials (4 Marks)</a>
          </div>

          <a href="/practice/class-10" class="module-btn gold">
            Solve All Class 10 Board Sets →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- MODULE 2: SAMPLE PAPERS & CASE STUDY MASTERCLASS -->
        <div class="two-col-grid">
          <!-- CARD 2A -->
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-header">
              <span class="module-icon">📑</span>
              <div>
                <span class="module-tag">CBSE PATTERN 2024-25</span>
                <h3>CBSE Class 10 Board Sample Papers</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Full 80-Mark Sample Question Papers (Standard & Basic Math) strictly formatted according to official CBSE blueprint.</p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
              <li>✓ Standard Mathematics Practice Paper (80 Marks)</li>
              <li>✓ Basic Mathematics Practice Paper (80 Marks)</li>
              <li>✓ Step-by-Step Marking Scheme & Solutions</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/practice/class-10" class="module-btn">Start Sample Paper →</a>
          </div>

          <!-- CARD 2B -->
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-header">
              <span class="module-icon">⚡</span>
              <div>
                <span class="module-tag">COMPETENCY BASED</span>
                <h3>Case Study & 5-Mark Masterclass</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Target Section E Case-Study Questions (12 Marks) and Section D 5-Mark Theorem Proofs (20 Marks) to secure 100/100.</p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
              <li>✓ Trigonometry Height & Distance Case Studies</li>
              <li>✓ Coordinate Geometry Seating Grid Problems</li>
              <li>✓ Circles Tangent Theorem Proofs</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/practice/class-10" class="module-btn">Start Case Study Practice →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-container">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="The Concepts Adda" />
        <div>
          <strong>The Concepts Adda</strong>
          <span>Understand. Practice. Master.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/classes">Classes</a>
        <a href="/practice">Practice</a>
        <a href="/exam-preparation">Exam Prep</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} The Concepts Adda. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #14213d;
    font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }

  .prep-class-main {
    min-height: 80vh;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* NAVBAR */
  .prep-navbar {
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
  }

  .nav-container {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    height: 76px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #f4c430;
  }

  .brand-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .brand-tagline {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover,
  .nav-links a.active {
    color: #2563eb;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .class-prep-hero {
    padding: 60px 0 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #fffbe6 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .hero-container {
    width: min(800px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: #d97706;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb-dot {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .class-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .class-pill.gold {
    background: #fef3c7;
    color: #b45309;
  }

  .class-prep-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: #0f172a;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .gold-text {
    color: #d97706;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* MODULES */
  .modules-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .section-container {
    width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .module-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .featured-gold {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff 0%, #fffbe6 100%);
    border: 2px solid #fcd34d;
  }

  .module-header {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .module-icon {
    font-size: 32px;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  .module-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;

    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .module-tag.gold {
    color: #b45309;
  }

  .module-header h2, .module-header h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .module-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .chapters-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .chapters-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .chapter-badge {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #1e293b;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .chapter-badge.gold-border {
    border-color: #fcd34d;
  }

  .chapter-badge:hover {
    border-color: #d97706;
    color: #d97706;
    background: #fef3c7;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .two-col-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .two-col-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: #334155;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .module-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 750;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .module-btn:hover {
    background: #1d4ed8;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .module-btn.gold {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706 0%, #b45309 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer {
    background: #0d172b;
    color: white;
    padding: 60px 0 25px;
  }

  .footer-container {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-brand img {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #f4c430;
  }

  .footer-brand div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: white;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 30px auto 0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #64748b;
  }
</style>
